@startuml
!include _astyle.iuml
title 5.4  Outside Vendor (OV) Repair (QP.33) — Activity
|Customer|
start
:Deliver item;
|Stores|
:Deliver to workshop;
|Workshop|
:Beyond capability; annotate Defect Report (F135);
|Stores|
:Dispatch to Central Stores (F218, F135, AM 75);
|PCE|
:Register (F125); identify vendor (<=15 days);
:Request OV Approval (F134);
if (Customer approved?) then (no)
  |Stores|
  :Return item to customer;
  stop
else (yes)
  |PCE|
  :Prepare PO (F312); dispatch to contractor (F218);
  |Contractor|
  :Advise repair cost & EDD;
  |PCE|
  :Submit Price Quotation (F119);
  |Customer|
  :Approve (MSU);
  |Contractor|
  :Submit proforma invoice;
  |Finance|
  :Arrange payment;
  |Contractor|
  :Return repaired item + certificates;
  |Stores|
  :Receiving inspection & test (QP.15);
  :Return item to customer (F311, F117, F218);
  stop
endif
@enduml
